{{Quote|And for your information, I ''am'' the boss. I am Duke Solha of the Free System of Serenno.|Solha, to Anakin Skywalker and Thrawn|audio=Solha1.flac|<ref name="Thrawn: Alliances">''[[Thrawn: Alliances]]''</ref>}}
The '''Serenno system''',<ref name="BMF 70" /> also known as the '''Free System of Serenno''',<ref name="Thrawn: Alliances" /> was a [[star system]] located in the [[Outer Rim Territories]] of [[the galaxy]]. It contained the [[planet]] [[Serenno]], the [[homeworld]] of [[Count]] [[Dooku]]. During the [[Outer Rim Sieges]] of the [[Clone Wars]], the system became the focus of [[Republic Military|military]] action from the [[Galactic Republic]].<ref name="BMF 70" />

